window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/security-v27-088-aea3655414fa15ec.json"]={sha256:"aea3655414fa15ec72fbdeec97bb4ae24e4e2140616f76619269d5e34803d1ff",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v27-case-3f1aed5827e8e8e9","url":"https://docs.ceph.com/en/latest/rados/operations/placement-groups/","title":"Ceph placement groups","titleEn":"Ceph placement groups","publisher":"Ceph","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"security-v27-088","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"security-v27-088","related":[{"id":"security-v27-089","referenceUrls":["https://docs.aws.amazon.com/whitepapers/latest/disaster-recovery-workloads-on-aws/disaster-recovery-options-in-the-cloud.html"],"title":"AWS災難復原：pilot light與warm standby的啟動相依成本","titleEn":"AWS disaster recovery: pilot-light and warm-standby activation dependencies","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付replica-map.csv、rack-failure-matrix.csv及policy-boundaries.md，明示未模擬網路分割、恢復期間第二次故障及真實CRUSH運算。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver replica-map.csv, rack-failure-matrix.csv and policy-boundaries.md. Explicitly exclude network partitions, failures during recovery and real CRUSH execution from the model so its conclusions remain properly scoped.","difference":"建立每方案準備狀態、啟動工作圖與每月教學成本，計算可驗證恢復時間及每縮短一分鐘的額外假設成本。","differenceEn":"Describe each plan starting state, activation task graph and illustrative monthly cost. Calculate verified recovery time and the incremental assumed cost per minute of recovery improvement.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["Ceph透過placement groups及放置規則配置資料；本課用明確機架清單與最低兩份的教學服務門檻，不將其當成任何叢集預設。 本課所有數值、事件與系統狀態均為原創合成資料；只在本機檔案與授權隔離練習中處理，不接觸生產設備或他人資料。 A副本在R1,R2,R3，B在R1,R1,R2；三機架各輪流單獨故障一次，教學門檻為至少兩份存活。 A各次皆存活2份，通過3/3=100%；B失R1僅剩1，失R2剩2，失R3剩3，通過2/3=66.666667%。","AWS文件區分pilot light與warm standby等策略；本課時間與點數成本是原創假設，非AWS價格、服務等級保證或現成採購建議。 本課所有數值、事件與系統狀態均為原創合成資料；只在本機檔案與授權隔離練習中處理，不接觸生產設備或他人資料。 P方案依序擴容12分鐘、啟動8、同步5、驗證5，成本100點/月；W方案擴容4、同步3、驗證5，成本250點/月。 P需30分鐘、W需12，縮短18分鐘；每月增150點，每縮短一分鐘對應150/18=8.333333點/月。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Ceph uses placement groups and placement rules to place data. This fixture uses explicit rack locations and a two-copy teaching service threshold, not an assertion about any cluster default configuration. Every quantity, event and system state below is original synthetic teaching data. Work only on local files or an explicitly authorized isolated lab, without production access or other people’s data. A replicas are on R1,R2,R3; B replicas are on R1,R1,R2. Fail each of the three racks separately, requiring at least two surviving copies under the exercise policy. A retains two copies in every case and passes 3/3=100%. B retains one after R1 loss, two after R2 loss and three after R3 loss, passing 2/3=66.666667%.","AWS documentation distinguishes pilot light and warm standby strategies. Durations and cost points here are original assumptions, not AWS prices, service guarantees or a ready-made purchasing recommendation. Every quantity, event and system state below is original synthetic teaching data. Work only on local files or an explicitly authorized isolated lab, without production access or other people’s data. Plan P serially scales for twelve minutes, starts for eight, synchronizes for five and verifies for five, costing 100 points/month. Plan W scales for four, synchronizes for three and verifies for five, costing 250. P requires thirty minutes and W twelve, improving recovery by eighteen. The additional 150 monthly points correspond to 150/18=8.333333 points per month for each minute of modeled improvement.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"security-v27-098","referenceUrls":["https://csrc.nist.gov/pubs/sp/800/61/r3/final"],"title":"NIST SP 800-61r3：決策證據新鮮度與重新評估觸發","titleEn":"NIST SP 800-61r3: evidence freshness and decision reassessment triggers","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付replica-map.csv、rack-failure-matrix.csv及policy-boundaries.md，明示未模擬網路分割、恢復期間第二次故障及真實CRUSH運算。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver replica-map.csv, rack-failure-matrix.csv and policy-boundaries.md. Explicitly exclude network partitions, failures during recovery and real CRUSH execution from the model so its conclusions remain properly scoped.","difference":"為每個決策依據保存observed_at、適用範圍、來源與本地政策有效期；在固定決策時間判定新鮮、過期或未知，並保留歷史。","differenceEn":"Record observed_at, scope, source and a locally defined lifetime for each decision input. At a fixed decision time, classify evidence as fresh, stale or unknown while preserving its history.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["Ceph透過placement groups及放置規則配置資料；本課用明確機架清單與最低兩份的教學服務門檻，不將其當成任何叢集預設。 本課所有數值、事件與系統狀態均為原創合成資料；只在本機檔案與授權隔離練習中處理，不接觸生產設備或他人資料。 A副本在R1,R2,R3，B在R1,R1,R2；三機架各輪流單獨故障一次，教學門檻為至少兩份存活。 A各次皆存活2份，通過3/3=100%；B失R1僅剩1，失R2剩2，失R3剩3，通過2/3=66.666667%。","NIST SP 800-61r3把事件回應納入風險管理；本課有效期是合成組織政策，並非NIST要求的分鐘數，也不把新鮮等同真實。 本課所有數值、事件與系統狀態均為原創合成資料；只在本機檔案與授權隔離練習中處理，不接觸生產設備或他人資料。 決策時間60分鐘，五份依據的觀測時間為55、40、30、50、未知；各自有效期10、15、30、5、10分鐘，邊界age≤TTL算新鮮。 年齡5、20、30、10、未知，第一與第三新鮮、第二與第四過期、第五未知；新鮮比例2/5=40%。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Ceph uses placement groups and placement rules to place data. This fixture uses explicit rack locations and a two-copy teaching service threshold, not an assertion about any cluster default configuration. Every quantity, event and system state below is original synthetic teaching data. Work only on local files or an explicitly authorized isolated lab, without production access or other people’s data. A replicas are on R1,R2,R3; B replicas are on R1,R1,R2. Fail each of the three racks separately, requiring at least two surviving copies under the exercise policy. A retains two copies in every case and passes 3/3=100%. B retains one after R1 loss, two after R2 loss and three after R3 loss, passing 2/3=66.666667%.","NIST SP 800-61r3 integrates incident response with risk management. Evidence lifetimes here are synthetic organizational policy, not NIST-prescribed minute values, and freshness alone does not establish truth. Every quantity, event and system state below is original synthetic teaching data. Work only on local files or an explicitly authorized isolated lab, without production access or other people’s data. Decision time is minute sixty. Five inputs were observed at 55,40,30,50 and unknown, with respective lifetimes 10,15,30,5,10 minutes. Define freshness inclusively as age no greater than lifetime. Ages are five, twenty, thirty, ten and unknown. The first and third are fresh, second and fourth stale, fifth unknown, giving a fresh-input fraction of 2/5=40%.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v27-case-de61aa8594aac5a8","url":"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/whitepapers/latest/disaster-recovery-workloads-on-aws/disaster-recovery-options-in-the-cloud.html","title":"AWS disaster recovery of workloads","titleEn":"AWS disaster recovery of workloads","publisher":"AWS","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v27-case-f53ed62dd159700c","url":"https://csrc.nist.gov/pubs/sp/800/61/r3/final","title":"NIST SP 800-61 Revision 3","titleEn":"NIST SP 800-61 Revision 3","publisher":"NIST","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
